his workspace section is delivered by the client and matter workspace card.</p></section><section id="issues-and-claims" aria-label="Issues and claims" tabindex="-1"><h2>Issues and claims</h2><p class="sl-record-meta">This workspace section is delivered by the client and matter workspace card.</p></section><section id="authorities" aria-label="Authorities" tabindex="-1"><h2>Authorities</h2><p class="sl-record-meta">This workspace section is delivered by the client and matter workspace card.</p></section><section id="communications" aria-label="Communications" tabindex="-1"><h2>Communications</h2><p class="sl-record-meta">This workspace section is delivered by the client and matter workspace card.</p></section><section id="deadlines-and-tasks" aria-label="Deadlines and tasks" tabindex="-1"><h2>Deadlines and tasks</h2><p class="sl-record-meta">This workspace section is delivered by the client and matter workspace card.</p></section><section id="work-products" aria-label="Work products" tabindex="-1"><h2>Work products</h2><p class="sl-record-meta">This workspace section is delivered by the client and matter workspace card.</p></section><section id="actions-and-receipts" aria-label="Actions and receipts" tabindex="-1"><h2>Actions and receipts</h2><p class="sl-record-meta">This workspace section is delivered by the client and matter workspace card.</p></section><section id="audit" aria-label="Audit" tabindex="-1"><h2>Audit</h2><p class="sl-record-meta">This workspace section is delivered by the client and matter workspace card.</p></section></article>"`;

